-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "5f35dba7-7b86-5c82-83c0-dbf58e502ebf" :answer-field/choices "cee2c378-b3ae-5d85-ae7e-47e9f7d4b976"] [:db/add "5f35dba7-7b86-5c82-83c0-dbf58e502ebf" :answer-field/choices "a723154a-a31d-503b-9579-bae0b8ee2011"] [:db/add "5f35dba7-7b86-5c82-83c0-dbf58e502ebf" :answer-field/correct "a723154a-a31d-503b-9579-bae0b8ee2011"] [:db/ensure "5f35dba7-7b86-5c82-83c0-dbf58e502ebf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/id #uuid "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0"] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/problem "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=\\frac{4 y}{x},\\qquad x\\ne 0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=- 2 x^{4}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=- 8 x^{3}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation."] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Differentiating $f(x)=- 2 x^{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(- 2 x^{4}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=-2\\cdot 4 x^{3} \\\\ &=- 8 x^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Substituting $y=- 2 x^{4}$ and $y\\prime=- 8 x^{3}$ into the original equation gives an identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{4 y}{x} \\\\ - 8 x^{3} &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{4\\left(- 2 x^{4}\\right)}{x} \\\\ - 8 x^{3} &=- 8 x^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the function $y=- 2 x^{4}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/answer-fields "32dbae71-0c96-559b-b891-eaff9a25935a"] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/answer-fields "e5666fa9-c3aa-5e43-b2c8-bbc511366f41"] [:db/add "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/answer-fields "5f35dba7-7b86-5c82-83c0-dbf58e502ebf"] [:db/ensure "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/questions "729ec480-d7e2-58dc-a850-b9ff69610ca0"] [:db/add "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36" :answer/id #uuid "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36"] [:db/add "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36" :answer/validate] [:db/add "51c96df9-a022-5711-b0b4-862aa2e02436" :answer/id #uuid "51c96df9-a022-5711-b0b4-862aa2e02436"] [:db/add "51c96df9-a022-5711-b0b4-862aa2e02436" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "51c96df9-a022-5711-b0b4-862aa2e02436" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "51c96df9-a022-5711-b0b4-862aa2e02436" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/id #uuid "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4"] [:db/add "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/key "I"] [:db/add "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/choices "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36"] [:db/add "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/choices "51c96df9-a022-5711-b0b4-862aa2e02436"] [:db/add "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/correct "57dd76c7-1580-54a7-8702-832f92b56a36"] [:db/ensure "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a" :answer/id #uuid "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a"] [:db/add "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cdfe72b8-fa2e-56cf-b8f3-590b7c422024" :answer/id #uuid "cdfe72b8-fa2e-56cf-b8f3-590b7c422024"] [:db/add "cdfe72b8-fa2e-56cf-b8f3-590b7c422024" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "cdfe72b8-fa2e-56cf-b8f3-590b7c422024" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "cdfe72b8-fa2e-56cf-b8f3-590b7c422024" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/id #uuid "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47"] [:db/add "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/key "II"] [:db/add "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/choices "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a"] [:db/add "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/choices "cdfe72b8-fa2e-56cf-b8f3-590b7c422024"] [:db/add "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/correct "a1537077-2732-5997-8cda-6940defc768a"] [:db/ensure "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555" :answer/id #uuid "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555"] [:db/add "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3c669eed-d1b3-5024-8bdb-7d4214af06fe" :answer/id #uuid "3c669eed-d1b3-5024-8bdb-7d4214af06fe"] [:db/add "3c669eed-d1b3-5024-8bdb-7d4214af06fe" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "3c669eed-d1b3-5024-8bdb-7d4214af06fe" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "3c669eed-d1b3-5024-8bdb-7d4214af06fe" :answer/validate] [:db/add "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/id #uuid "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2"] [:db/add "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/key "III"] [:db/add "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/choices "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555"] [:db/add "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/choices "3c669eed-d1b3-5024-8bdb-7d4214af06fe"] [:db/add "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/correct "646a3baf-7c68-5935-a198-a09a52711555"] [:db/ensure "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/id #uuid "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8"] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/problem "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=\\frac{3 y}{x},\\qquad x\\ne 0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=- 6 x^{2}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=- 24 x.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation."] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Differentiating $f(x)=- 6 x^{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(- 6 x^{2}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=-6\\cdot 2 x \\\\ &=- 12 x \\\\ &\\not\\equiv - 24 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. Substituting $y=- 6 x^{2}$ and $y\\prime=- 12 x$ into the original equation gives expressions that are not identical:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{3 y}{x} \\\\ - 12 x &\\overset{?}{=}\\frac{3\\left(- 6 x^{2}\\right)}{x} \\\\ - 12 x &\\not\\equiv - 18 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since statement II is false, the function $y=- 6 x^{2}$ is not a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/answer-fields "7a0c4a37-dc9b-5b7b-98ce-2b41b1443ec4"] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/answer-fields "aa93174e-a1e8-55a5-9b08-c1c23b7d6e47"] [:db/add "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/answer-fields "194c9336-9913-5379-9825-4dba3d9209d2"] [:db/ensure "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/questions "53a41d24-47c9-59a3-bb8f-2ba3ae6870d8"] [:db/add "5748cdfc-a23f-59d4-91c2-ae08e9280e33" :answer/id #uuid "5748cdfc-a23f-59d4-91c2-ae08e9280e33"] [:db/add "5748cdfc-a23f-59d4-91c2-ae08e9280e33" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "5748cdfc-a23f-59d4-91c2-ae08e9280e33" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "5748cdfc-a23f-59d4-91c2-ae08e9280e33" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9de1de88-c726-5d02-8e26-1f3e4b3f5434" :answer/id #uuid "9de1de88-c726-5d02-8e26-1f3e4b3f5434"] [:db/add "9de1de88-c726-5d02-8e26-1f3e4b3f5434" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "9de1de88-c726-5d02-8e26-1f3e4b3f5434" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "9de1de88-c726-5d02-8e26-1f3e4b3f5434" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b2bea227-c17b-57ad-af47-5aaca6599235" :answer-field/id #uuid "b2bea227-c17b-57ad-af47-5aaca6599235"] [:db/add "b2bea227-c17b-57ad-af47-5aaca6599235" :answer-field/key "I"] [:db/add "b2bea227-c17b-57ad-af47-5aaca6599235" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "b2bea227-c17b-57ad-af47-5aaca6599235" :answer-field/choices "5748cdfc-a23f-59d4-91c2-ae08e9280e33"] [:db/add "b2bea227-c17b-57ad-af47-5aaca6599235" :answer-field/choices "9de1de88-c72